#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/blocaled.xml:110
#, xml-text
msgid "<filename>/etc/blocaled.conf</filename>"
msgstr "<filename>/etc/blocaled.conf</filename>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/blocaled.xml:115
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/blocaled.conf"
msgstr "/etc/blocaled.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/blocaled.xml:119
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/blocaled.xml:122
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<filename>/etc/blocaled.conf</filename> contains the location of the "
"settings files used by <application>blocaled</application>. The defaults are"
" suitable for BLFS. Information about the entries is available as comments "
"in the file."
msgstr ""
"<filename>/etc/blocaled.conf</filename> contém o local dos arquivos de "
"configurações usados por <application>blocaled</application>. Os padrões são"
" adequados para BLFS. Informações relativas às entradas estão disponíveis "
"como comentários no arquivo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/blocaled.xml:129
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <emphasis>org.freedesktop.locale1</emphasis> protocol is unable to "
"export locale variables. Locale settings are stored by default in "
"<filename>/etc/locale.conf</filename>. We need to retrieve them in the bash "
"profile. As the <systemitem class=\"username\"> root</systemitem> user, "
"issue:"
msgstr ""
"O protocolo <emphasis>org.freedesktop.locale1</emphasis> é inapto para "
"exportar variáveis de localidade. As configurações de localidade são "
"armazenadas por padrão em <filename>/etc/locale.conf</filename>. Precisamos "
"recuperá-las no perfil do \"bash\". Como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\"> root</systemitem>, emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/blocaled.xml:136
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/profile.d/i18n.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/profile.d/i18n.sh\n"
"\n"
"if [ -r /etc/locale.conf ]; then source /etc/locale.conf; fi\n"
"\n"
"if [ -n \"$LANG\" ];              then export LANG; fi\n"
"if [ -n \"$LC_TYPE\" ];           then export LC_TYPE; fi\n"
"if [ -n \"$LC_NUMERIC\" ];        then export LC_NUMERIC; fi\n"
"if [ -n \"$LC_TIME\" ];           then export LC_TIME; fi\n"
"if [ -n \"$LC_COLLATE\" ];        then export LC_COLLATE; fi\n"
"if [ -n \"$LC_MONETARY\" ];       then export LC_MONETARY; fi\n"
"if [ -n \"$LC_MESSAGES\" ];       then export LC_MESSAGES; fi\n"
"if [ -n \"$LC_PAPER\" ];          then export LC_PAPER; fi\n"
"if [ -n \"$LC_NAME\" ];           then export LC_NAME; fi\n"
"if [ -n \"$LC_ADDRESS\" ];        then export LC_ADDRESS; fi\n"
"if [ -n \"$LC_TELEPHONE\" ];      then export LC_TELEPHONE; fi\n"
"if [ -n \"$LC_MEASUREMENT\" ];    then export LC_MEASUREMENT; fi\n"
"if [ -n \"$LC_IDENTIFICATION\" ]; then export LC_IDENTIFICATION; fi\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/profile.d/i18n.sh</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/profile.d/i18n.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Começo /etc/profile.d/i18n.sh\n"
"\n"
"if [ -r /etc/locale.conf ]; then source /etc/locale.conf; fi\n"
"\n"
"if [ -n \"$LANG\" ];              then export LANG; fi\n"
"if [ -n \"$LC_TYPE\" ];           then export LC_TYPE; fi\n"
"if [ -n \"$LC_NUMERIC\" ];        then export LC_NUMERIC; fi\n"
"if [ -n \"$LC_TIME\" ];           then export LC_TIME; fi\n"
"if [ -n \"$LC_COLLATE\" ];        then export LC_COLLATE; fi\n"
"if [ -n \"$LC_MONETARY\" ];       then export LC_MONETARY; fi\n"
"if [ -n \"$LC_MESSAGES\" ];       then export LC_MESSAGES; fi\n"
"if [ -n \"$LC_PAPER\" ];          then export LC_PAPER; fi\n"
"if [ -n \"$LC_NAME\" ];           then export LC_NAME; fi\n"
"if [ -n \"$LC_ADDRESS\" ];        then export LC_ADDRESS; fi\n"
"if [ -n \"$LC_TELEPHONE\" ];      then export LC_TELEPHONE; fi\n"
"if [ -n \"$LC_MEASUREMENT\" ];    then export LC_MEASUREMENT; fi\n"
"if [ -n \"$LC_IDENTIFICATION\" ]; then export LC_IDENTIFICATION; fi\n"
"\n"
"# Fim /etc/profile.d/i18n.sh</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/blocaled.xml:159
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Then the <filename>/etc/locale</filename> file should be generated, as the "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Então o arquivo <filename>/etc/locale</filename> deveria ser gerado, como "
"o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/blocaled.xml:163
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/locale.conf &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/locale.conf\n"
"\n"
"LANG=$LANG\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/locale.conf</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/locale.conf &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal># Começo /etc/locale.conf\n"
"\n"
"LANG=$LANG\n"
"\n"
"# Fim /etc/locale.conf</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/blocaled.xml:172
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you plan to run an X (or Wayland) Window system, you may want to set up "
"your X keyboard. The best way to do it is to retrieve the settings from "
"<filename>/etc/sysconfig/console</filename>, and feed them to the "
"<application>blocaled</application> daemon. As the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você planeja executar um sistema de janelas \"X\" (ou \"Wayland\"), "
"[então] você possivelmente queira configurar seu teclado do \"X\". A melhor "
"maneira de fazer isso é a de recuperar as configurações a partir de "
"<filename>/etc/sysconfig/console</filename> e alimentá-las para o processo "
"de segundo plano <application>blocaled</application>. Como o(a) usuário(a) "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/blocaled.xml:179
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>source /etc/sysconfig/console &amp;&amp;\n"
"KEYMAP=${KEYMAP:-us}          &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"gdbus call --system                                             \\\n"
"           --dest org.freedesktop.locale1                       \\\n"
"           --object-path /org/freedesktop/locale1               \\\n"
"           --method org.freedesktop.locale1.SetVConsoleKeyboard \\\n"
"           \"$KEYMAP\" \"$KEYMAP_CORRECTIONS\" true true</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>source /etc/sysconfig/console &amp;&amp;\n"
"KEYMAP=${KEYMAP:-us}          &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"gdbus call --system                                            \\\n"
"           --dest org.freedesktop.locale1                       \\\n"
"           --object-path /org/freedesktop/locale1               \\\n"
"           --method org.freedesktop.locale1.SetVConsoleKeyboard \\\n"
"           \"$KEYMAP\" \"$KEYMAP_CORRECTIONS\" true true</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para><footnote><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/blocaled.xml:190
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The default Xorg configuration file is "
"<filename>/etc/X11/xorg.conf.d/30-keyboard.conf</filename>."
msgstr ""
"O arquivo padrão de configuração do Xorg é "
"<filename>/etc/X11/xorg.conf.d/30-keyboard.conf</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/blocaled.xml:189
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This should create or modify the Xorg configuration file<placeholder "
"type=\"footnote\" id=\"0\"/> to match the keyboard settings set in "
"<envar>KEYMAP</envar>."
msgstr ""
"Isso deveria criar ou modificar o arquivo de configuração do "
"Xorg<placeholder type=\"footnote\" id=\"0\"/> para corresponder às "
"configurações de teclado configuradas em <envar>KEYMAP</envar>."

